## 7. Offsite copy (not configured)

Offsite backups were off when this file was rendered (`RESTIC_BUCKET` empty or CHANGEME in site.env), so the
snapshots above exist only on the `${MODELS_DIR}` disk: losing that disk loses every backup. To add an
encrypted offsite copy (restic on S3), follow `walter/backup/OFFSITE.md` in the repo. Its setup
re-renders this file with the offsite restore steps.
